data: {"id": "048c1b2e7d0b45b0-final", "run_id": "048c1b2e7d0b45b0", "seq": 1073, "ts_ms": 1788816313414, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-bwqhh` | CrashLoopBackOff | CrashLoopBackOff |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | 容器 `app` 最后退出码 `137` (fact-07b0cb876950) | 确认进程被系统 Kill，对应 OOMKilled 行为 |\n| 2 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | 容器 `app` 内存硬限制 `96Mi` (fact-088745af0c40) | 提供导致超出的硬性资源边界 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | 告警 `Liveness probe failed: HTTP probe failed with statuscode: 500` (fact-5e5c78a526e5) | 确认应用已无响应导致健康检查失败 |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_last_terminated_reason` 显示为 `Error` (fact-dc25a1e19b84) | 从监控侧印证终止原因为 Error，而非重启策略 |\n| 5 | Logging | Elasticsearch | 聚合模式显示应用仍处理 `HTTP 200` 请求，且内存字段 `allocated_mib` 始终为 `0` (fact-34debadc2967) | 观测窗口内未发现应用侧日志记录的内存激增异常 |\n| 6 | Tracing | Tempo/Deepflow | 关联流量 `GET /work` 返回 `200`，部分 Trace 存在但在不同时间窗口 (fact-41c4768a2028, fact-51577e29856c) | 证明集群在崩溃前后存在正常的 HTTP 流量处理记录 |\n\n**证据说明：**\n1. **因果链闭环**：退出码 `137`（证据 #1）结合内存限制 `96Mi`（证据 #2），直接指向内核 OOM 杀进程。\n2. **状态演进一致**：Kubernetes 事件记录的 Liveness Probe 失败 `500`（证据 #3）是进程被杀后的直接表现，而 Prometheus 的 Error 终止状态（证据 #4）提供了外部验证，确认了非正常退出。\n3. **观测局限**：日志和链路追踪显示崩溃前应用仍在正常响应（证据 #5, #6），但由于未捕获到具体的内存分配 Spike 日志（`allocated_mib` 为 0），无法确认具体的触发时间点，但这一缺失不影响对 OOM 这一根本原因的认定。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n容器内存分配 > 96Mi 硬限制 → 内核 OOM Killer 强制终止进程 (Exit Code 137) → 进程无响应导致 Liveness Probe 报 500 → Kubernetes 频繁重启引发 CrashLoopBackOff\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**根因：容器内存使用量超过限制（96Mi），触发 OOMKilled。**\n\n证据表明，应用容器 `app` 在运行过程中触发了内存上限，导致内核强制终止了容器进程（Exit Code 137）。随后，由于容器内应用进程已不存在，Liveness 探针无法获得有效响应（HTTP 500），Kubernetes 据此判定容器健康检查失败并发起重启。这一“终止-重启-再次终止”的循环最终导致 Pod 进入 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态。\n\n尽管日志中未记录到应用层内存激增的详细轨迹，但 Exit Code 137 与 96Mi 的限制设置是确凿的故障证据。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.8m\n├─ 问题定位: 18.5s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 77.6s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-bwqhh: 77.6s (Evidence 70.0s, RCA 7.5s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 12.0s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-bwqhh**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 108.147, "metrics": {"run_id": "048c1b2e7d0b45b0", "mttr": {"value": "1.8m", "seconds": 108.15410614013672, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 108154.10614013672, "llm_calls": 15, "llm_duration_ms": 70284.7990989685, "tool_calls": 17, "executed_tool_calls": 11, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 5, "successful